  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Crime Intelligence II</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Kriminalunderr&#xe4;ttelse II</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Projektet &#xe4;r ett tre &#xe5;rs samarbete mellan RPS och serbiska inrikesministeriet d&#xe4;r parterna skall l&#xe4;gga grunden f&#xf6;r en ny kriminalunderr&#xe4;ttelsetj&#xe4;nst. Arbetet kommer att inkludera framtagandet av en strategi och organisation f&#xf6;r arbete med dessa fr&#xe5;gor samt utbildning i nya metoder och teknisk utrustning.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project is a three years cooperation between SNPB and the Serbian Ministry of Interior where the parties will lay the grounds for a new criminal intelligence unit. The Project will include the elaboration of a strategy and the preparation and planning of measures with this area as well as capacitybuilding in new methods and technical equpiment.</narrative>
  </description>
